<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτίθημι</span></b>  (pres.
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τιθοῦντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Callisth.
					1.29
				</span></i>
			), <i>set against</i> or <i>so as to oppose,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλασσαίαισι δίναις ἀντιθέντα μένος
					στάλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					57
				</span></i>
			 (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>set against so as to balance, contrast,</i> or <i>compare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὠυτὸ ἀντιθήσω ἐκείνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.207
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.66
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο γὰρ ἀντίθες δυοῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					551
				</span></i>
			: also c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν Ἀθηναίων ἐκ πολλοῦ ἐμπειρίαν
					τῆς σφετέρας ἐξ ὀλίγου μελέτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.85
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.56
			</span></i>: with a Prep., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.175
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be contrasted,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός
				τι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				257d
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				258e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί τινα</span>
			<i>match</i> one <i>against</i> the other <i>in battle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσους ἴσοισι . . ἀντιθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					750
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				353
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be matched</i> one <i>against</i> another, of
			counteracting tendencies, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.50
			</span></i>; of opposing motives, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>retort, rejoin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίθες παρρησίᾳ ὅπως . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					1049
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιθεῖσ᾽ ἀμείψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					917
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> intr.,
				<i>oppose, resist,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸν Δία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.24.24
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>place</i> or <i>deposit in return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιθέντας ἐν ναοῖς ἢ χαλκὸν ἢ . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					620
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.14.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τί τινος</span>
			<i>give</i> one thing <i>for</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήν ἐνθάδ᾽ Αὖλιν ἀντιθεῖσα τῆς
					ἐκεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					358
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
